"to the 'dialout' group (and logging out/back in) along with reattaching your "
"radio to your PC will typically ensure this."
msgstr ""
"请确保您有访问该端口的权限。通常将自己加入 'dialout' 组 (并注销后重新登录)，"
"然后重新连接电台与电脑即可。"

