#: src/voicekeyer.cpp
msgid ""
"The selected voice keyer file does not have a high enough sample rate to "
"guarantee acceptable audio quality. Please ensure that your file's sample "
"rate is 16 kHz or greater."
msgstr ""
"所选语音键控器文件的采样率不够高，无法保证可接受的音频质量。请确保文件的采样"
"率为 16 kHz 或更高。"

#: src/voicekeyer.cpp
msgid ""
"The selected voice keyer file must only contain a single channel. Please use "
"an audio editor to convert the file to a mono file."
msgstr ""
"所选语音键控器文件只能包含单个声道。请使用音频编辑器将文件转换为单声道。"

#: src/voicekeyer.cpp
msgid "Too Many Channels"
msgstr "声道数过多"

#: src/voicekeyer.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Voice Keyer: Playing file %s to mic input"
msgstr "语音键控器: 正在将文件 %s 播放到麦克风输入"
